From: Andrey Lazarev <lazarev@tactiqedge.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] scripts: allow rpi to build without OF_BOARD

On BCM283x, OF_HAS_PRIOR_STAGE implies OF_BOARD, and U-Boot takes its
control devicetree from the VideoCore firmware. That tree is assembled by
the firmware from files on the FAT partition and from config.txt, none of
which is verified, and it cannot carry the FIT verification key, which is
inserted into U-Boot's own tree at build time.

The TactiQ Pi 4 build therefore turns OF_BOARD off and uses the tree
appended to u-boot.bin (OF_SEPARATE). scripts/check-of.sh refuses that
combination unless the board's SYS_CONFIG_NAME is listed in
scripts/of_allowlist.txt; list "rpi" there.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [TactiQ trust model: the control devicetree must carry the FIT key]
---
 scripts/of_allowlist.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/scripts/of_allowlist.txt b/scripts/of_allowlist.txt
index e82cf55..1ab7dff 100644
--- a/scripts/of_allowlist.txt
+++ b/scripts/of_allowlist.txt
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
 # List of boards which are permitted to use OF_HAS_PRIOR_STAGE without OF_BOARD
+rpi
